&P430951 = ASJ 18, 021 
#atf: lang akk 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. asz-szum-i-szu {d}en-ki sza ib-ni-a-ni 
#tr.en: On account of him, O Enki, who made me -- 
2. bu-bu-tam s,u2-ma-am ub-lam 
#tr.en: he has brought hunger, thirst upon me, 
3. ku-s,a-am u3 du-bu-ub-tam 
#tr.en: chills and misery  
4. e-li-ia it-ta-di 
#tr.en: he has cast upon me -- 
5. szum-ma t,a-ab-kum u3 li-ib-ba-ka 
#tr.en: if it pleases you, then your wish 
6. qi2-bi-szum-ma i#-na# qi2#-bi#?-[it?] {d}en-ki 
#tr.en: tell him, that by [command?] of Enki 
7. wa-szi-ib eridu{ki} [... wu-'i]-ir-szu 
#tr.en: who dwells in Eridu ...,  
$ single ruling 
8. a-na-ku ra-bu-ut {d}en-[ki ...] 
#tr.en: that I the greatness of Enki [...]  
9. lu-usz-ku-un# 
#tr.en: may establish!
$ single ruling 
10. asz-szum-i-szu la i-ha-ba-lu-ni#-in#-[ni] 
#tr.en: On account of him, lest he harm me. 
